# Peer Review

## Severity

- **High** — any failure → revision required
- **Medium** — multiple failures → revision; single → accept with note
- **Low** — accept; optional note

## Review All Areas

Instructions · Environment · Oracle · Verifiers · Rubrics · Structure · Metadata · Milestones

Find **all** issues before requesting revision.

## Local Checks

```bash
./scripts/terminus validate <task-dir>
./scripts/terminus oracle <task-dir>
./scripts/terminus llmaj-check <task-dir>
```

## Difficulty (High for #54 only)

- **#45:** CHECK when `difficulty` in `task.toml` — platform classified / agent-tier mismatch is **never** a blocker
- **#54:** UNCHECK only when **worst-model** (lowest agent pass rate) **>80%**
- Sum reference: `task.toml` difficulty vs platform `Difficulty:` line — informational in section 7 only

## Rubric (High)

- **Positive point cap:** non-milestone total ≤40; each milestone block ≤40 — **>40 = main blocker → Revise**
- Sum every `Agent …, +N` line in the platform rubric from the submission export

